# Monorepo-root build context (used by dis/services/dis-ui-server/Dockerfile, built
# from here). The Dockerfile's explicit COPYs bound the IMAGE; this file bounds the
# CONTEXT sent to the daemon, keeping ~1.6GB of virtualenvs / node_modules / git out
# of it. None of these are ever a COPY source.
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.terraform/
